{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament\/neidhardtii"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}],"extendedModule":"IvorTuning","role":"symbol","title":"neidhardtII","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"neidhardtII","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV"}],"externalID":"s:10IvorTuning0B6SystemPA2A15WellTemperamentVRszrlE11neidhardtIIAEvpZ::SYNTHESIZED::s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WellTemperament"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"roleHeading":"Type Property","symbolKind":"property"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/neidhardtII"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Neidhardt II (“Small City”; Johann Georg Neidhardt, 1724)."}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"neidhardtII","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three fifths — C→G, G→D, D→A — are each narrowed by ⅙ of the Pythagorean comma"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(≈ 698.045 cents). Six fifths — A→E, B→F♯, F♯→C♯, C♯→A♭, B♭→F, F→C — are each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"narrowed by 1\/12 of the Pythagorean comma (≈ 700.000 cents). The remaining three"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fifths — E→B, A♭→E♭, E♭→B♭ — are pure. The circle closes exactly:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"3×(1\/6) + 6×(1\/12) = 1 Pythagorean comma."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sectio Canonis Harmonici","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (Königsberg, 1724). Neidhardt relabeled this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification “Large City” in his 1732 revision."}]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/WellTemperament":{"abstract":[{"text":"A tuning system in which all twelve keys are usable but have distinct tonal characters,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"achieved by distributing the Pythagorean comma unevenly around the circle of fifths.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","title":"WellTemperament","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/WellTemperament/neidhardtII":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"neidhardtII","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/neidhardtII","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Neidhardt II (“Small City”; Johann Georg Neidhardt, 1724)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament\/neidhardtii","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"neidhardtII","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV"}],"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WellTemperament"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning":{"abstract":[{"text":"Musical pitch, interval, and tuning system types.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning","title":"IvorTuning"}}}